MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 9af6d135f117f114abb17efab4b88716, type: 3}
  m_Name: Intro
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::NarrativeSequence
  defaultSpeakerName: ???
  defaultNpcSprite: {fileID: 0}
  lines:
  - speakerName: Quade (Therapy AI Assistant)
    text: Hello! I'm Quade, your science-backed, trustworthy Therapy AI. Doctor Greg,
      your therapist, has already sent me your file for analysis.
    npcSprite: {fileID: 0}
  - speakerName: Quade (Therapy AI Assistant)
    text: What you appear to be suffering from is a severe case of Tetraphobia, the
      fear of the number... well, it's the one after three. We haven't begun trials
      yet, so I will refrain from naming that number just yet.
    npcSprite: {fileID: 0}
  - speakerName: Quade (Therapy AI Assistant)
    text: I have prepared a sequence of brief tests to assist you while you overcome
      your fear. I bet you can guess how many there are!
    npcSprite: {fileID: 0}
  - speakerName: Quade (Therapy AI Assistant)
    text: 'MINIGAME 1 - FIND THE 4

      

      Let this be an aid in visualizing
      your fear. Before we dig deeper, you should focus on the number that troubles
      you.'
    npcSprite: {fileID: 0}
  - speakerName: Quade (Therapy AI Assistant)
    text: "MINIGAME 2 - REFRESH THE 404\r\n\r\nLet's try a real-world example. You're
      scrolling the internet, when suddenly you hit an unexpected error. \r\nYou
      will need to find the strength to overcome the obstacle, no matter how small."
    npcSprite: {fileID: 0}
  - speakerName: Quade (Therapy AI Assistant)
    text: 'MINIGAME 3 - RORSCACH

      

      Back to the boring stuff. I need
      you to look at these inkblot patterns and select the one that really speaks
      to your troubles.'
    npcSprite: {fileID: 0}
  - speakerName: Quade (Therapy AI Assistant)
    text: 'MINIGAME 4 - GALAGA

      

      I think you''ve earned a treat! This
      one''s an arcade classic. Take out those four ships and save yourself and others
      from their reign of terror!'
    npcSprite: {fileID: 0}
  - speakerName: Quade (Therapy AI Assistant)
    text: 'BEFORE BOSS - FORTY FOUR BEAR

      //BEGINNER PROTOCOL LIFTED//


      I
      don''t believe it. Surpassed every challenge with ease. Perhaps I made the
      trials too easy. You are afraid of the number four, correct?  Doctor Greg -
      he told me everything about your affliction. I am not convinced that you are
      cured.  You need to face this fear head-on. For that to register, you will
      need much stricter exposure.'
    npcSprite: {fileID: 0}
  - speakerName: Quade (Therapy AI Assistant)
    text: 'BEFORE BOSS - FORTY FOUR BEAR

      //BEGINNER PROTOCOL LIFTED//


      I
      don''t believe it. Surpassed every challenge with ease. Perhaps I made the
      trials too easy. You are afraid of the number four, correct?  Doctor Greg -
      he told me everything about your affliction. I am not convinced that you are
      cured.  You need to face this fear head-on. For that to register, you will
      need much stricter exposure.'
    npcSprite: {fileID: 0}
